  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.110.6:\n- OpenMaui.Controls.Linux.Pdf: PDF rendering and text on Linux, with Google's PDFium\n- `ILinuxWebView`: a WebView's browser, the same on WPE WebKit and WebKitGTK\n- `LinuxWebViewHandler`: one public WebView handler on either engine\n- CommunityToolkit's `IconTintColorBehavior` tints an `Image`'s or `ImageButton`'s icon\n- A library's handler for its own subclass of a framework control was ignored\n- A CollectionView or CarouselView whose `ItemTemplate` is a `DataTemplateSelector` showed nothing\n- Controls inside a CollectionView row lost the binding context they set for themselves\n- Controls inside a CollectionView row never got the pointer\n- A download from a WebView went straight to the Downloads folder without asking\n- A CollectionView's EmptyView that is a view was never shown\n- An Image with `Aspect=\"AspectFill\"` drew its picture over the views around it\n- The Shell navigation bar showed none of the page's `ToolbarItems`\n- A vertical ScrollView took all the height it was offered, however short its content\n- The Shell navigation bar showed the flyout item's title instead of the page's\n- MediaElement ignored `ShouldLoopPlayback`, and never raised `MediaEnded`\n- A MediaElement with `Aspect=\"AspectFill\"` drew its video over the views around it\n- An SfListView's sticky group header slid down from the top once the list was scrolled back up\n- `PlatformBehavior` crashed when its view loaded (NullReferenceException in `PlatformBehavior.OnLoaded`)\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
